    "description": "You can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check in place of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check when attempting to change the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a> of an undomesticated creature with an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> score of 2 or less. Additionally, you do not take the normal -5 penalty on the check if the creature can't speak or understand your language.<br><br>This Talent is identical to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charm_Beast\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charm Beast\">Dathomiri Witch Talent</a> of the same name, and both are considered to be the same Talent for the purposes of satisfying prerequisites.",
